WEBVTT

00:03:28.675 --> 00:03:32.703
nine, eight, seven, six --

00:03:32.703 --> 00:03:35.251
(Space shuttle preparing for takeoff)

00:03:35.251 --> 00:03:38.143
-- start, two, one,

00:03:38.143 --> 00:03:42.286
booster ignition, and liftoff of 
the space shuttle Discovery,

00:03:42.286 --> 00:03:46.317
returning to the space station, paving the way ...

00:03:46.317 --> 00:03:57.884
(Space shuttle taking off)

00:03:58.901 --> 00:04:01.161
Chris Hadfield: It is incredibly powerful